per\'s acceptance. Consider the following aspects: the overall soundness of the research, the clarity of the presentation, the significance of the contributions, and the strengths and weaknesses highlighted by the reviewer. Assess whether the overall evaluation leans towards acceptance or rejection based on the review\'s content. Classify the paper as suitable for acceptance (Yes) or rejection (No) based on the review\'s summary, soundness rating, presentation quality, contribution assessment, and the balance of strengths versus weaknesses." \n\n# Output format\nAnswer Yes or No as labels\n\n# Prediction\nText: {{ text }}\nLabel:']
